    "stac_version": "1.1.0",
    "description": "Skin samples for genetic analysis were collected, using a crossbow, from\nAntarctic Peninsula Humpback Whales from three austral summers (1995/96,\n1996/97 and 1997/98).  Dr. C. Scott Baker from Auckland University, New Zealand\nand Dr. Luis Medrano from Universidad Nacional Aut\u00f3noma de M\u00e9xico also\nparticipated in this study. The objective of this study is to  genetically\nidentify humpbacks that feed in this Antarctic waters. Using PCR technique\nmitochondrial DNA, actin intron and microsateslites 52 samples were identified.\nSex was also identified.",
